# Never commit private novel/campaign contents or raw model interactions.
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.venv/
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.egg-info/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.log
